.TH IOWATCHD-LOG 1 "October 2026" "iowatchd 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
iowatchd-log \- show the alerts logged by iowatchd
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B iowatchd-log
[\fIN\fR | \fB\-f\fR | \fB\-s\fR | \fB\-h\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shortcut to read \fI/var/log/iowatchd.log\fR and the service state.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I N
Show the last \fIN\fR lines (default 50).
.TP
.B \-f
Follow the log in real time.
.TP
.B \-s
Show the service status (systemd, OpenRC or runit).
.TP
.B \-h
Show help.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR iowatchd (8)
